==History==
*12/12/24:
**{{Balance|Neutral|Buzz Lightyear was temporarily added to the game for the Pizza Planet event, and was available for every user to claim for free until 31/12.}}
*18/12/24:
**{{Balance|Nerf|Buzz Lightyear's main attack damage was decreased to 2160 (from 2320) while in Laser Mode.}}
**{{Balance|Nerf|The number of hits necessary to charge Buzz Lightyear's Super was increased to 6 hits (from 5) while in Laser Mode.}}
**{{Balance|Nerf|Buzz Lightyear's health was decreased to 8400 (from 9000) while in Saber Mode.}}
**{{Balance|Nerf|The number of hits necessary to charge Buzz Lightyear's Super was increased to 5 hits (from 4) while in Saber Mode.}}
**{{Balance|Neutral|Fixed Buzz Lightyear's Hypercharge description not displaying the correct icon for Speed stats, instead of the Health icon.}}
**{{Balance|Neutral|Fixed a bug where winning or losing with Buzz Lightyear would display previous trophy loss or gains on the home screen.}}
**{{Balance|Neutral|Fixed a bug where Buzz Lightyear flying out of the map would crash the game.}}
**{{Balance|Neutral|Fixed a bug where Buzz Lightyear would play [[Surge]] Lightyear's voice lines upon being defeated.}}
*09/01/25:
**{{Balance|Buff|Buzz Lightyear can now immediately attack after using his Super while in Wing Mode.}}
*04/02/25:
**{{Balance|Neutral|Buzz Lightyear was removed from the game.}}
*25/02/25:
**{{Balance|Neutral|Fixed a bug where Buzz Lightyear would appear in the cosmetic bank, in the leaderboard, and in some profiles after his removal.}}
*04/03/25:
**{{Balance|Neutral|Fixed a bug where collected Trophies for Buzz Lightyear would still count towards total Trophies for some players.}}
**{{Balance|Neutral|Fixed the message in inboxes saying "SHELLY the Brawler is not available anymore." instead of BUZZ LIGHTYEAR.}}

